  "short_description": "<p>Eco-friendly and elegant <strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1724\">Bamboo Box Made in Vietnam</strong>, handcrafted by skilled artisans using sustainable bamboo. Perfect for storage, gifting, and decoration.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"596\"><strong data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"272\">Product Description:</strong><br data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"275\" />Our <strong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"309\">Bamboo Box Made in Vietnam</strong> is a beautifully handcrafted storage solution made from 100% natural bamboo, sourced from sustainable plantations in Northern Vietnam. Each box is skillfully woven and finished by experienced artisans, ensuring durability, elegance, and an eco-friendly alternative to plastic storage.</p>\n<p data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"849\">The bamboo is carefully treated, polished, and sealed to highlight its natural texture while protecting it from moisture. Lightweight yet sturdy, this bamboo box is perfect for organizing home essentials, storing gifts, or enhancing retail displays.</p>\n<p data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"1011\">By choosing our bamboo products, you support rural Vietnamese communities, preserve traditional craftsmanship, and contribute to environmental sustainability.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1032\"><strong data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1030\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1468\">\n<li data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1103\">\n<p data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1103\"><strong data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1048\">Material:</strong> 100% natural bamboo – eco-friendly and biodegradable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1180\">\n<p data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1180\"><strong data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1124\">Craftsmanship:</strong> Handwoven and finished by skilled Vietnamese artisans</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1244\">\n<p data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1244\"><strong data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1194\">Design:</strong> Durable structure with smooth, polished surface</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1315\">\n<p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1315\"><strong data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1256\">Uses:</strong> Storage, packaging, home décor, retail display, gift box</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1316\" data-end=\"1403\">\n<p data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1403\"><strong data-start=\"1318\" data-end=\"1337\">Sustainability:</strong> Made from renewable resources with minimal environmental impact</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1468\">\n<p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1468\"><strong data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1417\">Origin:</strong> Made in Vietnam, supporting local craft villages</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1831\">",
